# Original class replaced with: PatchedKimiK3Experts
# Reason: Use v5 gate_up_proj expert weights ([E, 2I, H] F.linear layout) and the instance-local moe_experts VeomniOp (kimi_k3 variant for SituGLU, standard otherwise).
